{"step_index":984,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T19:04:33Z","content":"The UI overhaul is complete. The application is styled as a cyber-industrial mission-control dashboard designed for high-density telemetry, clear information hierarchy, and judging presentations.\n\n---\n\n### Key UI Enhancements Applied:\n\n1. **Mission-Control Command Header & HUD**:\n   - **Real-Time Telemetry Strip**: Displays live neural engine state, multi-stage Theory of Constraints status, Arena v16.2 protocol, and active loaded models.\n   - **5 Unified KPI Stat Tiles**: High-contrast tiles for *Units Inspected*, *Defects Identified (with dynamic color-coded rate)*, *Review Queue*, *Simulation Models Tracker*, and *Neural Inference Engine State*.\n\n2. **Tab 1: Quality Inspection**:\n   - **Redesigned Gallery Cards**: Each inspected unit features a header with filename, glowing status pill (`PASS`, `DEFECT`, `UNCERTAIN`, `NOVEL`), dark glass border, **custom confidence gradient bar** (`0-100%`), pixel-level bounding box coordinates, and top probability breakdowns.\n   - **Analytics & Defect Drift**: Defect donut, class breakdown bar chart, searchable telemetry log, and quality drift monitor.\n\n3. **Tab 2: Production Flow Health**:\n   - **Interactive Plant Process Topology**: Horizontal SCADA process flowchart (`Raw Stock` &rarr; Processing Stations &rarr; `Shipped Goods`) displaying real-time utilization percentages, glowing bottleneck cards, and animated pulse indicators.\n   - **TOC Bottleneck Diagnostic**: Highlights the primary constraint station, queue delays, throughput gap, and Little's Law WIP buffer counts.\n\n4. **Tab 3: Root Cause Analysis**:\n   - **Causal Evidence Matrix**: Multi-tier evidence cards with color-coded severity borders connecting upstream machine overloads directly to physical defect types.\n   - **Defect Drift & OOD Queue**: Real-time drift slope (pp/unit) and isolated review table for edge cases.\n\n5. **Tab 4: Profitability & What-If Simulator**:\n   - **5-Tile Financial Dashboard**: Color-coded KPI cards (*Gross Revenue*, *Scrap Loss*, *Idle Cost*, *Opportunity Loss*, and *Operating Margin*).\n   - **What-If Optimization Cockpit**: Sliders for bottleneck idle reduction and scrap rate reduction with immediate projected margin recovery calculations.\n   - **Prioritized Action Plan**: Ranked engineering fixes with direct dollar-value recovery estimates.\n   - **One-Click Executive Report Export**: Generates and downloads an executive markdown summary.\n\n6. **Tab 5: Digital Twin (ANN Surrogate Engine)**:\n   - **Metamodel Architecture HUD**: Visual schematic of the 2-layer ANN (`Input Layer` &rarr; `10 Hidden Tansig Neurons` &rarr; `Purelin Output` &rarr; `<0.05ms Latency`).\n   - **Real-Time Input Control**: Sliders with automated prescriptive capacity solver.\n   - **Cyber Gauge Forecast**: Glowing dial gauges with safety thresholds and continuous parameter sweep response curves.\n   - **Rockwell Arena vs. ANN Surrogate Benchmarking**: Goodness-of-fit metrics ($R^2$, $RMSE$, $MAE$) with interactive correlation scatter plots.\n\n---\n\n### Strict Guidelines Verified:\n- **Zero emojis** throughout the entire UI and codebase.\n- **Zero mentions of \"NEURAX 3.0\"** — standardized to *\"Autonomous Quality & Process Intelligence Platform\"*."}
